                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5164 Lever with 5046 Rosette - Modern homes would do well to have this ultra sleek Baldwin made leverset on the doors. Constructed out of solid brass, the 5164 Lever with 5046 Rose is available in 3 contemporary finishes and it features concealed mounting screws to insure a minamalistic look. It will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5164-5046 Baldwin Brass 5164 Levers, Baldwin Brass Sleek Leverset, Baldwin 5164-5046 leversets, baldwin 5046 roses, solid brass leversets, contemporary levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin 5164 leversets, baldwin 5046 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, baldwin modern levers, ada compliant levers, Baldwin Estates Collection 5164 Lever With 5046 Rosette,"
